================================================================================
1. OCaml / OxCaml runtime
================================================================================

The dio and dio-dashboard executables are compiled with, and statically link,
the OCaml runtime (libasmrun) from OxCaml, Jane Street's fork of OCaml. The
image is built with the 5.2.0+ox switch (ocaml-variants.5.2.0+ox,
oxcaml-compiler.5.2.0minus40).

